-----------------------
Netrw CRUD Operations
-----------------------

------------------
Create
------------------
d - Make a dir
% - Make a file (Opens a buffer)


------------------
* Read
------------------
 | Preview |
 p - Preview the file
 ctrl+w, z - Close the preview
 ctrl+w, P - Jump to preview

 x - View file with associated program
 qf - Display file information
 a - cycle between

------------------
  opening file
------------------
 v - open the file in vertical split
 o - open the file in a horizontal split
 t - open the file in a new tab



------------------
Update
------------------
 R - Rename file/dir

  

------------------
Delete
------------------
 D - delete file/dir (enter for file, y + enter for dir)


-----------------------
File operations
-----------------------
gp - change file permission

